#### 4. Sleepy Test
**Ref:** Peruma et al., ESEC/FSE 2020 — *Sleepy Test*; Camara et al., SAST 2021 (correlated with flakiness)
**Test:** `ProcessOrder_AsyncNotification_IsSent` (line 91)

```csharp
Thread.Sleep(2000);
```

**Risk:** Non-deterministic — 2 seconds may not be enough on a loaded CI agent, and it's always too long on a fast machine. A top contributor to flaky test suites per Camara et al.

**Fix — poll or use async/await:**
```csharp
[TestMethod]
public async Task ProcessOrder_AsyncNotification_IsSent()
{
    var processor = new OrderProcessor(_db, _email, _inventory);
    var order = new Order { Items = { new OrderItem("SKU-1", 1) } };

    await processor.ProcessOrderAsync(order);

    Assert.IsTrue(_email.WasNotificationSent(order.Id));
}
```

