### MEDIUM Severity

#### 5. Eager Test
**Ref:** van Deursen et al., 2001 — *Eager Test*
**Test:** `OrderProcessor_FullWorkflow_Succeeds` (line 52)

```csharp
processor.ValidateOrder(order);
processor.CalculateTotal(order);
processor.ApplyDiscount(order, "SAVE10");
processor.ReserveInventory(order);
processor.ProcessPayment(order, new CreditCard("4111111111111111"));
processor.SendConfirmation(order);
processor.UpdateOrderHistory(order);
```

7 distinct production methods in one test. When it fails, any of the 7 calls could be the cause.

**Fix:** Split into focused tests per method, or if this intentionally tests the full workflow, mark it as an integration test with `[TestCategory("Integration")]` and keep separate unit tests for each step.

